<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Universe – Voidforge</title></head>
<body>
<nav>
<p><strong>Voidforge</strong> <a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/fleets">Fleets</a> · Universe · <a href="/leaderboard">Leaderboard</a></p></nav>
<p>Logged in as <strong>alice@voidforge.test</strong>.</p>
<form method="post" action="/logout"><button type="submit">Log out</button></form>
<hr>
<h1>Universe</h1>
<p><strong>Enter numbers like 150 or −20.5; the radius must be 0 or more.</strong></p>
<form method="get" action="/universe">
<p>Centre: <label>x 
<input type="text" name="x" value="&lt;b&gt;" size="10"></label> <label>y 
<input type="text" name="y" value="1" size="10"></label> <label>z 
<input type="text" name="z" value="2" size="10"></label> <label>Radius 
<input type="text" name="radius" value="3" size="8"> u</label> <button type="submit">Search</button></p></form></body></html>
